@startuml coach-line
' purpose: how tutorial coach lines are chosen, held, and shown
' covers: apps/starchess/src/tutorial/tutorialScript.config.ts
' covers: apps/starchess/src/screens/TutorialScreen.tsx
' covers: apps/starchess/src/__tests__/tutorialScript.test.ts
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/proveo-ca/identity/main/proveo.puml

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

title StarChess · Tutorial coach line resolution

component "tutorialScript.config.ts\nchecked catalog" as Config <<db>>
component "resolveTutorialLine\nfirst match wins" as Resolver <<app>>
component "holdTutorialLine\nsticky intro latch" as Hold <<app>>
component "TutorialScreen\nline + outcome effects" as Screen <<app>>
component "TutorialGuideBubble\ncoach / success" as Bubble <<app>>
component "fog skin demo\n2s + 2s timer" as SkinDemo <<async>>
component "resolveTutorialHints\n+ Arrows, same step" as Hints <<app>>

Config ARROW_MAIN Resolver : catalog reactions + hints
Resolver ARROW_MAIN Hold : raw intro or reaction
Hold ARROW_MAIN Screen : held line per lesson key
Screen ARROW_MAIN Bubble : message + action CTA
SkinDemo ARROW_OPTIONAL Screen : auto flip, cancels on hand
Hints ARROW_OPTIONAL Screen : rings + lines, demo-gated

note as N1
Resolver walks the declared reaction
catalog in order and returns the first
clause matching board context. Copy
edits stay safe because tests name each
reaction by order, so guards catch moves.
end note
N1 .. Resolver

note as N2
Hold shows the intro until acting, then
latches the reaction and never revives
the opener. Turn-open bookkeeping
re-baselines seed on checks flip, while
unflagged hosts still retire on any move.
end note
N2 .. Hold

note as N3
Fog lessons auto-play the skin toggle
after two seconds and hold hints until
the round trip ends. Arming lives only
in interface targeting state and never
reaches the wire, so targeting announces.
end note
N3 .. SkinDemo

note as N4
Outcome judges settled boards only, so
mid-resolve placements never trip gates.
Ending holds the closing line for reading
time, then success offers Next with a
visible auto-advance border countdown.
end note
N4 .. Screen

' --- IGNORE: layout hints (do not edit) ---
Config -[hidden]- Resolver
Resolver -[hidden]- Hold
Screen -[hidden]- Bubble
' --- END IGNORE ---
@enduml
